    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19622" root="سرق" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرِقٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرِقَةٌ</span></b>  [the former of which is said
in the Mgh and K, and the latter in the K, to be
an inf. n., are also said to be] substs. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَقَ</span>,
[as such signifying <i>Theft,</i>] as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْقَةٌ</span></b> , (O, K,)
or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِرْقَةٌ</span></b> . (Msb.)

